emist forces on both sides of the aisle bent on tearing us apart. We believe that we need to begin the process of showing our country and politicians that what is happening in Washington is unacceptable and it is time to act.</p>","type":"GROUP","url":"https://events.pol-rev.com/@first_in_freedom_again"}],"total":59}}}